# NetGulf - Project Rules

## General
- Flutter 3.24+ app for Saudi net salary calculator 2026 (Offline First)
- Full RTL + Arabic support (Cairo font)
- Use Riverpod 2.6+ (NotifierProvider + ConsumerWidget)
- Clean Architecture (features/ folder)
- Material 3 design, emerald + navy + gold theme
- GOSI calculations must be 100% accurate

## Key Files
- GOSI logic: lib/features/salary_calculator/models/gosi_model.dart
- Salary state: lib/features/salary_calculator/providers/salary_notifier.dart
- Main screen: lib/features/salary_calculator/presentation/home_screen.dart

## Style
- Modern, clean, professional UI
- Big net salary card with gradient
- Use SegmentedButton for nationality and regime
- Always use const where possible
- Good comments in Arabic/English

## Workflow
- When I say "build HomeScreen", implement full UI + connect to SalaryNotifier
- Always test after major changes
- Follow existing structure

